OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 5 APR
OL,4,G1900FSunday Feature: February House
OL,5,     GFor a year during World War II,
OL,6,     Gan unremarkable residence in
OL,7,     GBrooklyn Heights, New York City,
OL,8,     Gbecame an epicentre of Western
OL,9,     Gmusic and literature.
OL,10,G1945FWords and Music
OL,11,     GReadings from Natalie Simpson and
OL,12,     GRay Fearon on the transcendent
OL,13,     Gand numinous, from Shakespeare
OL,14,     Gand Donne to Wordsworth and
OL,15,     GLarkin. Music from Beethoven to
OL,16,     GBruckner.
